    "These ceilings combine the applicable policy sources. Grants and individual connections can restrict access further." : {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "These ceilings combine the applicable policy sources. Grants and individual connections can restrict access further."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "这些上限综合了适用的策略来源。授权和单个连接可进一步限制访问。"}}}},
