    "No clients or plugins are connected yet." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "No clients or plugins are connected yet."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "还没有客户端或插件连接。"}}}},
    "Managed Limits" : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Managed Limits"}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "托管限制"}}}},
    "Managed limits cap what can be granted here. A source that can't be read limits everything it could limit until it can be read." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Managed limits cap what can be granted here. A source that can't be read limits everything it could limit until it can be read."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "托管限制决定这里最多能授予什么。无法读取的来源，在能读取之前，会把它可以限制的设置全部按最严处理。"}}}},
    "This Mac" : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "This Mac"}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "这台 Mac"}}}},
    "Computer MCP holds these macOS permissions for everything it runs in the sandbox. What each client or plugin may use of them is set above." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Computer MCP holds these macOS permissions for everything it runs in the sandbox. What each client or plugin may use of them is set above."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Computer MCP 为它在沙盒中运行的程序持有这些 macOS 权限。每个客户端或插件能用到多少，在上面设置。"}}}},
    "Full Access is turned on from a client's or plugin's page, and needs your confirmation on this Mac." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Full Access is turned on from a client's or plugin's page, and needs your confirmation on this Mac."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "完全访问需要在客户端或插件的页面中开启，并在这台 Mac 上确认。"}}}},
