    "Clients and plugins with access to a project can read it. With Read & Write they can change it in worktrees and merge their work back." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Clients and plugins with access to a project can read it. With Read & Write they can change it in worktrees and merge their work back."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "有项目权限的客户端和插件可以读取项目；有“读写”权限的还可以在 worktree 中修改并把改动合并回去。"}}}},
    "Allow host tools and sandboxed programs to read files in these folders." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Allow host tools and sandboxed programs to read files in these folders."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "允许宿主工具和沙盒程序读取这些文件夹中的文件。"}}}},
