    "Use the keyboard and pointer, perform accessibility actions and open files in apps. This acts on your whole desktop, outside any sandbox." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Use the keyboard and pointer, perform accessibility actions and open files in apps. This acts on your whole desktop, outside any sandbox."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "使用键盘和指针、执行辅助功能操作、在应用中打开文件。它作用于整个桌面，不受沙盒限制。"}}}},
