    "The existing entry uses settings Computer MCP couldn't restore if replacing it failed. Remove it in %@ first." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "The existing entry uses settings Computer MCP couldn't restore if replacing it failed. Remove it in %@ first."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "现有条目包含替换失败时 Computer MCP 无法还原的设置。请先在 %@ 中移除它。"}}}},
