    "Each client runs the App-owned bridge. Changes to a client's settings are shown for review first." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Each client runs the App-owned bridge. Changes to a client's settings are shown for review first."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "每个客户端都运行由应用管理的桥接。修改客户端设置前会先显示更改供您检查。"}}}},
