    "Other principals’ host tools and sandboxed programs cannot read files in the plugin’s sandbox container. Files in shared projects follow the project’s permissions." : {"localizations" : {"en" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "Other principals’ host tools and sandboxed programs cannot read files in the plugin’s sandbox container. Files in shared projects follow the project’s permissions."}}, "zh-Hans" : {"stringUnit" : {"state" : "translated", "value" : "其他主体的宿主工具和沙盒程序无法读取该插件沙盒容器中的文件。共享项目中的文件遵循项目权限。"}}}},
